      "current_title": "Ask HN: I’m an FCC Commissioner proposing regulation of IoT security updates",
      "excerpt": "Hi everyone, I’m FCC Commissioner Nathan Simington, and I’m here to discuss security updates for IoT devices and how you can make a difference by filing comments with the FCC. As you know, serious vulnerabilities are common in IoT, and it often takes too long for these to be patched on end-user devices—if the manufacturer even bothers to release an update, and if the device was even designed to receive them. Companies may cease supporting a device well before consumers have s",
      "rank": 1,
      "guide_zh": "FCC 委员征询社区意见，讨论如何监管物联网设备安全更新。"
